        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:1rem;">SDF Clothing has been producing hoodies and fleece garments for global fashion brands since 1998, working across 280-500 GSM cotton, cotton-poly, and French terry fabrics depending on the weight and hand-feel a brand needs. As certified <a href="/clothing-manufacturers" style="color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;text-decoration:none;">clothing manufacturers in Bangladesh</a>, we handle full OEM, ODM, and private label hoodie production from 300 pieces MOQ per style.</p>
